# deploy/docker/insight.Dockerfile 专用（BuildKit 按“<Dockerfile>.dockerignore”取用；上下文是仓库根目录）。
# 白名单：默认全部排除，只放进 COPY 的路径；.env、.venv、node_modules、legacy/、测试与夹具一律不进构建上下文。
*
!services/insight/requirements.lock
!services/insight/config
!services/insight/templates
!services/insight/insight
!services/learning/learning
!services/learning/review_console
!services/learning/config
!packages/contracts/openapi
!docs/design/sie/sie_lexicon.py
!docs/design/sie/forbidden-inference.v0.yaml
!docs/design/sie/field-dictionary.v0.9.yaml
!docs/design/sie/no-promise.v0.draft.yaml
# 白名单之后再排除一次：即使白名单目录里出现这些文件，也不进构建上下文
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/tests
**/fixtures
legacy
